repository-code: "https://github.com/salahealer9/new-jerusalem-geometry"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational and historical audit of John Michell's New
  Jerusalem geometry. The release includes source-calibrated reconstructions
  of Figures 12 and 14, deterministic Euclidean construction models, the exact
  algebraic boundary for regular sevenfold constructibility, a one-trisection
  cubic extension within the frozen project model, and a provenance-separated
  reconstruction of Michell's numerical interpretation of Plato's eight
  whorls. Historical source statements, project reconstructions, exact
  mathematical results, and unresolved archival attributions remain explicitly
  distinguished.
